  "changes": [
    "Vehicle model, brand, section and engine pages resolve awaited params and data on server; missing records use notFound before shell rendering.",
    "Vehicle navigation contains real server-rendered anchors. Search, filter, selected-record comparison, reports and votes are bounded client islands.",
    "Model/section/engine static generation uses shared quality gates; revalidate 1800 and dynamicParams true preserve ISR for other valid records.",
    "Presentation helpers and types extracted without changing catalogue records; lightweight qualified vehicle index replaces full arrays in selectors.",
    "Selected-vehicle API accepts at most three explicit IDs; car option API sends names only. No full heavy catalogue import is reachable from client entries.",
    "Shared anonymous navigation no longer eagerly imports Firestore/storage. Authentication and signed-in subscriptions load SDKs on demand; ads use a read-only public-field server projection.",
    "Legal/contact text, library legacy guides, market tables, events and community initial content are server-rendered; forms and live updates remain separate islands.",
    "ESLint directive-aware no-restricted-imports enforcement and transitive import/chunk audit prevent heavy catalogue regressions.",
    "Unsupported expert wording removed in modified chronic/engine descriptions; existing engine scores and catalogue assertions were not re-audited in this rendering step.",
    "Console-only DNA contribution confirmation replaced with real forum navigation; no submission success is simulated.",
    "Filter active states, event counts/empty messages and single H1 on equipment page preserve reviewed UI behavior."
  ],
